; dijonkitchen.org: the records served by Porkbun's nameservers.
; Kept in git so the zone can be loaded into any DNS host in minutes
; (ADR 2026-10-21-porkbun-registrar-and-dns). Porkbun is the source of
; truth; update this file in the same change as any edit made there.
; SOA and NS records are managed by the DNS host and left out.
$ORIGIN dijonkitchen.org.
$TTL 600

; Site: GitHub Pages. www is canonical (ADR 2026-10-14-www-as-canonical-host).
@       A       185.199.108.153
@       A       185.199.109.153
@       A       185.199.110.153
@       A       185.199.111.153
@       AAAA    2606:50c0:8000::153
@       AAAA    2606:50c0:8001::153
@       AAAA    2606:50c0:8002::153
@       AAAA    2606:50c0:8003::153
www     CNAME   dijonkitchen.github.io.

; Only Let's Encrypt (used by GitHub Pages) may issue certificates.
@       CAA     0 issue "letsencrypt.org"

; Email: Fastmail.
@                       MX      10 in1-smtp.messagingengine.com.
@                       MX      20 in2-smtp.messagingengine.com.
@                       TXT     "v=spf1 include:spf.messagingengine.com ?all"
fm1._domainkey          CNAME   fm1.dijonkitchen.org.dkim.fmhosted.com.
fm2._domainkey          CNAME   fm2.dijonkitchen.org.dkim.fmhosted.com.
fm3._domainkey          CNAME   fm3.dijonkitchen.org.dkim.fmhosted.com.
; Reports only for now; tighten to quarantine, then reject, after clean reports.
_dmarc                  TXT     "v=DMARC1; p=none; rua=mailto:dmarc@dijonkitchen.org"

; Ownership checks.
@                                       TXT     "google-site-verification=bitAFl3JsXWi27bpiFdEpNB-F0-tQkO0DhK_Yy25z8M"
_github-pages-challenge-dijonkitchen    TXT     "cd9449927f0827e1600e45c2fd5907"
; Bluesky handle @dijonkitchen.org.
_atproto                                TXT     "did=did:plc:e7pggp5deprxbwszlv254vmv"
